	(text "Alright so it's a pretty basic BSPD. It essentially only checks for hard\nbraking from the front and rear brake sensors (which is measuring for \n1500 psi on the brakes) and whether or not the tractive system current \ndelivering 5KW to the motor, in which case it activates a fault. I didn't\nimplement more than a couple things such as the relay/timer which would \nbe cool if I wasn't way over the deadline to submit this. I had planned\nto make this day my BSPD day but I ended up having to work on my ECE-13\nproject down to the last minute so no FS time for me (literally until \n12:00). All good though I thought what I made tonight or I guess today \nnow was pretty cool, even if it blows up in real life. The math \nequations for the voltage dividers are in the Notes! folder under \nBSPD-Attempt-Notes. "
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 224.282 84.074 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "49f020ca-972b-4294-a803-065f194e01aa")
	)
